<Paragraph><Strong>shopkeeper</Strong></Paragraph>
<H1>A little more room to run your shop.</H1>
<Paragraph>You're on the Shopkeeper waitlist. Thanks for being here.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>We're building an AI shopkeeper for solo Shopify stores: someone to answer customer questions and help with the work behind each order, while you stay in control of the decisions that matter.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>We'll email you when early access opens. If you chose product updates, you'll also hear from us occasionally as we build.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>What takes up more of your day than it should? Reply and tell me. I'd love to understand what would make the biggest difference for your shop.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>Rajbir, founder of Shopkeeper</Paragraph>
